§ `Tests -- s 35B(3), (4), (9): the rate and the 14-week period`

-- 90 per cent of the threshold for the tax year in which the week ends (30 pounds, or the order amount)
#ASSERT `s 35B(3) the weekly rate of the allowance` (Date 14 6 2025) NOTHING EQUALS 27
#ASSERT `s 35B(3) the weekly rate of the allowance` (Date 14 6 2025) (JUST 40) EQUALS 36
