#ASSERT `s 35B(3) the weekly rate of the allowance` (Date 5 4 2002) (JUST 40) EQUALS 27
#ASSERT `s 35B(3) the weekly rate of the allowance` (Date 6 4 2002) (JUST 40) EQUALS 36
