§ `Tests -- s 35B(5) to (8): when the 14-week period begins`

-- the expected week begins Sunday 15 June 2025; confinement on 20 June 2025
-- arguments: expected week, date of confinement, the day W ceased to work with S, the first day W refrained
-- (5): ceasing before the commencement of the 11th week (Sunday 30 March) starts the period at that commencement
#ASSERT `s 35B(8) the first day of the 14-week period` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) (JUST (Date 20 3 2025)) NOTHING EQUALS Date 30 3 2025
#ASSERT `s 35B(8) the first day of the 14-week period` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) (JUST (Date 29 3 2025)) NOTHING EQUALS Date 30 3 2025
-- (6): ceasing from 30 March to 17 May starts the period the day after
#ASSERT `s 35B(8) the first day of the 14-week period` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) (JUST (Date 30 3 2025)) NOTHING EQUALS Date 31 3 2025
#ASSERT `s 35B(8) the first day of the 14-week period` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) (JUST (Date 17 5 2025)) NOTHING EQUALS Date 18 5 2025
-- (7): ceasing from 18 May to the date of confinement, 20 June
#ASSERT `s 35B(8) the first day of the 14-week period` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) (JUST (Date 18 5 2025)) NOTHING EQUALS Date 19 5 2025
#ASSERT `s 35B(8) the first day of the 14-week period` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) (JUST (Date 20 6 2025)) NOTHING EQUALS Date 21 6 2025
-- (8): ceasing after the confinement, or not at all, starts the period the day after the confinement
#ASSERT `s 35B(8) the first day of the 14-week period` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) (JUST (Date 21 6 2025)) NOTHING EQUALS Date 21 6 2025
#ASSERT `s 35B(8) the first day of the 14-week period` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS Date 21 6 2025
-- (7)(b): refraining wholly or partly because of the pregnancy
#ASSERT `s 35B(8) the first day of the 14-week period` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) NOTHING (JUST (Date 1 6 2025)) EQUALS Date 2 6 2025
#ASSERT `s 35B(8) the first day of the 14-week period` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) NOTHING (JUST (Date 17 5 2025)) EQUALS Date 21 6 2025
-- both in the (7) window: the earlier of the two days
#ASSERT `s 35B(8) the first day of the 14-week period` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) (JUST (Date 25 5 2025)) (JUST (Date 1 6 2025)) EQUALS Date 26 5 2025
#ASSERT `s 35B(8) the first day of the 14-week period` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) (JUST (Date 10 6 2025)) (JUST (Date 1 6 2025)) EQUALS Date 2 6 2025
-- ceasing in (6)'s range and refraining in (7)'s: the earlier-numbered rule, (6)
#ASSERT `s 35B(8) the first day of the 14-week period` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) (JUST (Date 10 5 2025)) (JUST (Date 1 6 2025)) EQUALS Date 11 5 2025
-- ceasing after the confinement but refraining within the window: (7)
#ASSERT `s 35B(8) the first day of the 14-week period` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) (JUST (Date 25 6 2025)) (JUST (Date 1 6 2025)) EQUALS Date 2 6 2025
-- the helper for (7)
#ASSERT `s 35B(7) the day within the period on which W ceases or refrains` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) (JUST (Date 25 5 2025)) (JUST (Date 1 6 2025)) EQUALS JUST (Date 25 5 2025)
#ASSERT `s 35B(7) the day within the period on which W ceases or refrains` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) (JUST (Date 17 5 2025)) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 35B(7) the day within the period on which W ceases or refrains` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) (JUST (Date 17 5 2025)) (JUST (Date 18 5 2025)) EQUALS JUST (Date 18 5 2025)
#ASSERT `s 35B(7) the day within the period on which W ceases or refrains` `s 35 test expected week` (Date 20 6 2025) NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
